-- The doppelgangers.
--
-- Nineteen of them, levels 50 to 58, in region 245 -- the Hall of the
-- Corrupt, which already connects to New Frontiers by six zonepoints each
-- way. Thirteen doppelgangers and six doppelgangerlings, in two clusters.
--
-- The live Doppelganger Invasion seeds them through the frontier maze zones
-- and adds a Progenitor boss and a daily cull quest. Neither the Progenitor
-- nor the seeding is in this dump, so this is the population only -- the
-- creatures exist and can be found and killed, which is the part the data
-- supports. The event around them is a separate build.

ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `ClassType` = `ClassType`;
